5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! Since we're five people now, we really need a fair way to split the bills. I want us to feel comfortable using the heat and lights without worrying too much about the cost!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. The current system was for three people, so it's outdated. We need a method that ensures long-term predictability and doesn't lead to sudden, heavy costs for anyone during the winter.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I agree! But we should also make sure the new way isn't too hard to do. If it takes forever to calculate every month, someone is going to get really tired of it!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Fairness is a vague term, isn't it? If we want to avoid ""feeling"" worried, we need actual data. Let's stop guessing and see if some of us are actually subsidizing others.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Shunichi. We need data to avoid assumptions. However, we should also consider how the payment process affects our atmosphere. Let's look at the history and the actual usage patterns.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,I totally agree with Shunichi and Misaki! Data is key. I want to know how we've been doing things so far and if there's a way to make it feel fair for everyone.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, fairness is important, but we must also consider the upfront costs of any changes. I want to see the actual spending patterns over a full year to avoid any surprises in the winter.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, that makes sense! But I also want to see if there's a way to make the math easier. Maybe there's a template or a system other houses use so we don't have to struggle every month!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, a template is just a tool; it doesn't solve the underlying problem of unfairness. If the usage varies wildly between rooms, a simple template is just a faster way to be wrong.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shunichi, you're right that a tool isn't a solution. But we should also look at the payment log. I want to see if the act of settling up has caused any friction between us.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I think we should also check how the rooms differ! Some might be colder than others, right? I don't want anyone freezing just to save money. Let's look into the sunlight and heating needs!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, that's a valid point, but we shouldn't overlook the financial side. I want to know if there are any installation costs if we change how we track usage. We need a balance between comfort and cost.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, that's true! But if we spend a lot of time arguing over pennies, we'll be too tired to enjoy the house. I want to see how other people handle this without it becoming a huge chore!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, your obsession with convenience is charming, but efficiency without accuracy is useless. If we want to stop the rumors of people ""carrying"" others, we need to see the actual numbers per room.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shunichi, accuracy is important, but not at the cost of our relationships. I think we should look at the payment log and the last twelve utility statements to see the reality of our situation.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm glad we're all on the same page about needing data! I'll check the sunlight and heating need by room and the plug-in monitor readings room by room to see how we actually use energy!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will look into the last twelve utility statements to understand the annual spending patterns and the electrician's quote for the rooms to assess any potential upfront costs for a new system.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'll check the trial run of a reconciliation template and the monthly settle observed at another house! I want to find a way that's super fast and easy for everyone!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll examine the plug-in monitor readings room by room and the payment log for the last twelve months. Let's see if the ""burden"" some feel is a mathematical reality or just a feeling.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will look into the payment log for the last twelve months and the settling up when the last rooms filled. I want to see how the transition and payment habits have affected us.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
